# Every real .env file, anywhere in the repo — not just the root — since apps/web's own build
# step (`COPY apps/web .`) would otherwise bake a stray apps/web/.env's VITE_* values into the
# shipped bundle. .env.example files carry no secrets and stay, wherever they live.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
*.md
scripts/node_modules
terminals
.cursor
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
